      "definition": "(J) As used in this section, \"victim's immediate family\" means the mother, father, spouse, sibling, or child of the victim, provided that in no case does \"victim's immediate family\" include the offender with respect to whom the notice in question applies.\n\nLast updated January 25, 2023 at 11:29 AM",
